SWEET battery publish (patch 0153, plan 2026-11-14 oneshot-2 step C5): with sweetbatt=1 on gs101, SweetBattery (the iOS IOPMPowerSource of patch 0061)
publishes the last plausible MAX77759 read set of patch 0148 (sweet_batt_sample: soc, VCell, AvgCurrent, Temp) every 30 s instead of the static 100 %.
No hardware access in this patch. Before the first read set, or once the reader stopped, the static fallback stays (100 %, never 0 %).
External power / charging = AvgCurrent > +50 mA (the charger state is not read yet, step C6). New log line: "SWEET BATTERY: published N% ...".

Review 0148-0153-4 F1: once a real sample was published, a stopped reader or an implausible set keeps the last values (SweetBatteryStale = true).

